  "sourceQuirks": [
    "UT.Entities.applyPotion:3057 rejects duration<=0; negative-duration pill tuples are preserved but cannot remove effects. Milk callbacks remain effective.",
    "FoodStat calls the 1.7.10 four-argument PotionEffect constructor: the fourth argument is ambient, not modern particle visibility.",
    "LoaderItemList:753 binds IL.Bottle_Empty to minecraft:glass_bottle; no separate native bottle_empty item is required.",
    "No FoodStatDrink registered for Blood; its sandwich layer uses minimum one food and zero saturation."
  ],
